.TH TIMERFD_GETTIME 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
timerfd_gettime \- Linux x86-64 syscall 287
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_260_299.h>
.B int timerfd_gettime(int descriptor, struct itimerspec* value);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads timer descriptor state.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR timerfd_gettime (2)
